  "created": "2025-08-12T20:12:09.54Z",
  "description": "NotBot is a lightweight and secure CAPTCHA library for ASP.NET Core that helps protect your applications from bots by generating and verifying image-based CAPTCHAs. It uses cryptographic signatures and client fingerprinting (based on IP and User-Agent) to ensure that CAPTCHA tokens are unique, tamper-proof, and tied to the requesting client. NotBot also provides middlewares to easily extract necessary tokens and client info during HTTP requests.",
  "id": "NotBot",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-08-12T20:16:37.693Z",
